ry","phonetic":"/draɪ/","meaning":"干的"},{"grade":6,"word":"dirty","phonetic":"/ˈdɜːti/","meaning":"脏的"},{"grade":6,"word":"empty","phonetic":"/ˈempti/","meaning":"空的"},{"grade":6,"word":"high","phonetic":"/haɪ/","meaning":"高的"},{"grade":6,"word":"low","phonetic":"/ləʊ/","meaning":"低的"},{"grade":6,"word":"wide","phonetic":"/waɪd/","meaning":"宽的"},{"grade":6,"word":"narrow","phonetic":"/ˈnærəʊ/","meaning":"窄的"},{"grade":6,"word":"deep","phonetic":"/diːp/","meaning":"深的"},{"grade":6,"word":"weak","phonetic":"/wiːk/","meaning":"虚弱的"},{"grade":6,"word":"rich","phonetic":"/rɪtʃ/","meaning":"富有的"},{"grade":6,"word":"poor","phonetic":"/pɔː(r)/","meaning":"贫穷的"},{"grade":6,"word":"friendly","phonetic":"/ˈfrendli/","meaning":"友好的"},{"grade":6,"word":"honest","phonetic":"/ˈɒnɪst/","meaning":"诚实的"},{"grade":6,"word":"brave","phonetic":"/breɪv/","meaning":"勇敢的"},{"grade":6,"word":"careful","phonetic":"/ˈkeəfl/","meaning":"小心的"},{"grade":6,"word":"lazy","phonetic":"/ˈleɪzi/","meaning":"懒惰的"},{"grade":6,"word":"beautiful","phonetic":"/ˈbjuːtɪfl/","meaning":"美丽的"},{"grade":6,"word":"handsome","phonetic":"/ˈhænsəm/","meaning":"英俊的"},{"grade":6,"word":"cute","phonetic":"/kjuːt/","meaning":"可爱的"},{"grade":6,"word":"lovely","phonetic":"/ˈlʌvli/","meaning":"可爱的；美好的"},{"grade":6,"word":"ugly","phonetic":"/ˈʌɡli/","meaning":"丑陋的"}],"sentences":[{"en":"Good morning, boys and girls.","zh":"早上好，孩子们。"},{"en":"How are you? I'm fine, thank you.","zh":"你好吗？我很好，谢谢。"},{"en":"What's your name? My name is Tom.","zh":"你叫什么名字？我叫汤姆。"},{"en":"I have a pencil and a ruler.","zh":"我有一支铅笔和一把尺子。"},{"en":"This is my new friend, Lily.","zh":"这是我的新朋友，莉莉。"},{"en":"Look at my face and my nose.","zh":"看我的脸和鼻子。"},{"en":"I like apples and bananas.","zh":"我喜欢苹果和香蕉。"},{"en":"The cat is fat and happy.","zh":"这只猫又胖又开心。"},{"en":"This is my mother and that is my father.","zh":"这是我妈妈，那是我爸爸。"},{"en":"How many books do you have?","zh":"你有多少本书？"},{"en":"I see ten monkeys in the tree.","zh":"我看见树上有十只猴子。"},{"en":"Let's go to school together.","zh":"让我们一起上学吧。"},{"en":"We have English, maths and music today.","zh":"我们今天有英语、数学和音乐课。"},{"en":"My schoolbag is heavy.","zh":"我的书包很重。"},{"en":"Where is my toy car? It's under the desk.","zh":"我的玩具车在哪里？在书桌下面。"},{"en":"I can see a green tree and red flowers.","zh":"我能看到一棵绿树和红色的花。"},{"en":"My family has four people.","zh":"我家有四口人。"},{"en":"The farmer has many cows and sheep.","zh":"这位农民有很多奶牛和绵羊。"},{"en":"What time is it? It's seven o'clock.","zh":"几点了？七点了。"},{"en":"It's time for lunch.","zh":"该吃午饭了。"},{"en":"We have dinner at six in the evening.","zh":"我们晚上六点吃晚饭。"},{"en":"Today is Monday.","zh":"今天是星期一。"},{"en":"It's sunny and hot today.","zh":"今天晴朗又炎热。"},{"en":"I like spring because it is warm.","zh":"我喜欢春天，因为天气温暖。"},{"en":"Look at the big elephant.","zh":"看那头大象。"},{"en":"I want to buy a new dress.","zh":"我想买一条新连衣裙。"},{"en":"The shoes are too small for me.","zh":"这双鞋对我来说太小了。"},{"en":"My sister is a nurse.","zh":"我姐姐是一名护士。"},{"en":"He is a doctor in the hospital.","zh":"他是医院里的一名医生。"},{"en":"I get up at six and go to bed at nine.","zh":"我六点起床，九点睡觉。"},{"en":"We usually go to school by bus.","zh":"我们通常坐公交车去上学。"},{"en":"Turn right at the traffic lights.","zh":"在红绿灯处右转。"},{"en":"Go straight and you will see the library.","zh":"直走你就会看到图书馆。"},{"en":"I often play football after school.","zh":"放学后我经常踢足球。"},{"en":"She likes reading books in the library.","zh":"她喜欢在图书馆看书。"},{"en":"It's a beautiful day for a picnic.","zh":"今天是个野餐的好日子。"},{"en":"In winter we can make a snowman.","zh":"冬天我们可以堆雪人。"},{"en":"I want to be a scientist in the future.","zh":"将来我想成为一名科学家。"},{"en":"Happy birthday to you!","zh":"祝你生日快乐！"},{"en":"This present is for my best friend.","zh":"这份礼物是给我最好的朋友的。"},{"en":"I feel tired and want to rest.","zh":"我感觉很累，想休息一下。"},{"en":"Don't worry, I can help you.","zh":"别担心，我能帮助你。"},{"en":"We are going to visit the museum tomorrow.","zh":"我们明天要去参观博物馆。"},{"en":"Eating fruit is good for our health.","zh":"吃水果对我们的健康有好处。"},{"en":"The cat is sleeping on the sofa.","zh":"猫正在沙发上睡觉。"},{"en":"I am learning to swim this summer.","zh":"这个夏天我正在学游泳。"},{"en":"Do you like music? Yes, I do.","zh":"你喜欢音乐吗？是的，我喜欢。"},{"en":"My favourite subject is English.","zh":"我最喜欢的科目是英语。"},{"en":"The teacher is kind to her students.","zh":"这位老师对学生很和蔼。"},{"en":"We must cross the road carefully.","zh":"我们必须小心地过马路。"},{"en":"There are many trees in the forest.","zh":"森林里有很多树。"},{"en":"The little girl is singing a song.","zh":"小女孩正在唱一首歌。"},{"en":"My grandpa likes to take a walk in the park.","zh":"我爷爷喜欢在公园里散步。"},{"en":"Let's clean our classroom together.","zh":"让我们一起打扫教室吧。"},{"en":"I can draw a picture of my family.","zh":"我能画一幅我的家人的画。"}],"grammar":[{"category":"be动词","question":"I ___ a student.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":0,"explain":"主语是 I，be 动词用 am。","question_zh":"我是一名学生。"},{"category":"be动词","question":"She ___ my teacher.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 she 是第三人称单数，用 is。","question_zh":"她是我的老师。"},{"category":"be动词","question":"They ___ my friends.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":2,"explain":"主语 they 是复数，用 are。","question_zh":"他们是我的朋友。"},{"category":"冠词","question":"I have ___ apple on the table.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":1,"explain":"apple 以元音音素 /æ/ 开头，用 an。","question_zh":"桌子上有一个苹果。"},{"category":"冠词","question":"She is ___ teacher.","options":["a","an","the","/"],"answer":0,"explain":"teacher 以辅音音素开头，表示“一名”用 a。","question_zh":"她是一位老师。"},{"category":"介词","question":"The book is ___ the desk.","options":["in","on","at","to"],"answer":1,"explain":"在物体表面上用 on。","question_zh":"书在书桌上面。"},{"category":"介词","question":"The cat is ___ the box.","options":["in","on","at","of"],"answer":0,"explain":"在盒子里面用 in。","question_zh":"猫在盒子里面。"},{"category":"介词","question":"My dog is ___ the tree.","options":["under","in","on","to"],"answer":0,"explain":"在树下用 under。","question_zh":"我的狗在树下。"},{"category":"代词","question":"This is ___ book.","options":["I","me","my","mine"],"answer":2,"explain":"名词前用形容词性物主代词 my。","question_zh":"这是我的书。"},{"category":"代词","question":"Look at ___! She is dancing.","options":["she","her","hers","she's"],"answer":1,"explain":"介词后用人称代词宾格 her。","question_zh":"看她！她在跳舞。"},{"category":"复数","question":"I have two ___.","options":["apple","apples","appless","an apple"],"answer":1,"explain":"two 后面用名词复数 apples。","question_zh":"我有两个苹果。"},{"category":"复数","question":"There are many ___ in the tree.","options":["monkey","monkeys","monkies","a monkey"],"answer":1,"explain":"many 后接名词复数 monkeys，辅音+y 变 y 为 i 加 es 只适用于以 y 结尾且 y 前是辅音的词。","question_zh":"树上有许多猴子。"},{"category":"一般现在","question":"I ___ to school every day.","options":["go","goes","going","went"],"answer":0,"explain":"主语 I，一般现在时用动词原形 go。","question_zh":"我每天去上学。"},{"category":"一般现在","question":"She ___ apples.","options":["like","likes","liking","liked"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 she 第三人称单数，动词加 s 为 likes。","question_zh":"她喜欢苹果。"},{"category":"一般现在","question":"He ___ TV after dinner.","options":["watch","watches","watching","watched"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 he 三单，以 ch 结尾动词加 es 为 watches。","question_zh":"他晚饭后看电视。"},{"category":"现在进行","question":"Look! The cat ___ sleeping.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":0,"explain":"现在进行时 be + doing，主语 the cat 单数用 is。","question_zh":"看！猫正在睡觉。"},{"category":"现在进行","question":"They ___ playing football now.","options":["am","is","are","be"],"answer":2,"explain":"主语 they 复数，现在进行时用 are。","question_zh":"他们现在正在踢足球。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"I ___ swim in the river.","options":["can","is","am","do"],"answer":0,"explain":"情态动词 can 后接动词原形，表示能力。","question_zh":"我会在河里游泳。"},{"category":"情态动词","question":"You ___ cross the road now. It's red.","options":["can","can't","mustn't","don't"],"answer":1,"explain":"红灯时不能过马路，用 can't 表示禁止。","question_zh":"你现在不能过马路。是红灯。"},{"category":"疑问句","question":"___ you like music?","options":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"answer":0,"explain":"一般现在时一般疑问句，主语 you 用助动词 Do。","question_zh":"你喜欢音乐吗？"},{"category":"疑问句","question":"___ she have a cat?","options":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"answer":1,"explain":"主语 she 三单，一般疑问句用助动词 Does。","question_zh":"她有一只猫吗？"},{"category":"特殊疑问","question":"___ is your name?","options":["What","Where","Who","How"],"answer":0,"explain":"问名字用 What。","question_zh":"你叫什么名字？"},{"category":"特殊疑问","question":"___ is my ruler? It's on the desk.","options":["What","Where","Who","How"],"answer":1,"explain":"问地点用 Where。","question_zh":"我的尺子在哪里？在书桌上。"},{"category":"特殊疑问","question":"___ is that man? He is my teacher.","options":["What","Where","Who","How"],"answer":2,"explain":"问人是谁用 Who。","question_zh":"那个男人是谁？他是我的老师。"},{"category":"特殊疑问","question":"___ do you go to school? By bus.","options":["What","Where","Who","How"],"answer":3,"explain":"问交通方式用 How。","question_zh":"你怎么去上学？坐公交车。"},{"category":"时间介词","question":"We have lunch ___ twelve.","options":["in","at","on","for"],"answer":1,"explain":"具体时刻前用 at。","question_zh":"我们十二点吃午饭。"},{"category":"时间介词","question":"I go to school ___ Monday.","options":["in","at","on","to"],"answer":2,"explain":"具体星期几前用 on。","question_zh":"我星期一去上学。"},{"category":"时间介词","question":"We play outside ___ the afternoon.","options":["in","at","on","to"],"answer":0,"explain":"一天中的上午、下午、晚上用 in。","question_zh":"我们下午在外面玩。"},{"category":"there be","question":"There ___ a book on the desk.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":0,"explain":"there be 句型，a book 单数用 is。","question_zh":"书桌上有一本书。"},{"category":"there be","question":"There ___ many flowers in the garden.","options":["is","are","am","be"],"answer":1,"explain":"many flowers 复数，用 are。","question_zh":"花园里有很多花。"},{"category":"形容词","question":"The elephant is ___.","options":["big","a big","bigs","the big"],"answer":0,"explain":"be 动词后直接加形容词，无复数形式。","question_zh":"大象是大的。"},{"category":"代词","question":"___ is my brother.","options":["This","These","Those","They"],"answer":0,"explain":"单数近指用 This。","question_zh":"这是我的哥哥。"},{"category":"祈使句","question":"___ open the door, please.","options":["Please","Not","No","Don't"],"answer":3,"explain":"祈使句否定用 Don't。","question_zh":"请不要开门。"}]}
